# supercronic crontab — Bumblebee scans on DGX Spark
# Format: minute hour dom month dow command
# Timezone: container default (UTC). DGX local time is Europe/Helsinki.
#
# Daily 04:00 UTC (07:00 Helsinki summer / 06:00 winter) — project profile
0 4 * * *   /app/run-scan.sh project
# Weekly Sun 05:00 UTC — deep profile (whole host)
0 5 * * 0   /app/run-scan.sh deep
